Cell[TextData[{
 "The model is of Hodge type exactly when the fourth column vanishes \
throughout; the quotient map is then a quasi-isomorphism, so the second \
column is the cohomology of the quotient and is at most the fifth. The two \
agree exactly when the quotient carries no differential, which is to say when \
the quotient ",
 StyleBox["is", "TI"],
 " the cohomology and the model is formal."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"f63c1260-b200-4b8c-9be8-5f9d98a3a40f"],

